WEBVTT

00:01:43.504 --> 00:01:44.938
Begin!

00:01:58.485 --> 00:02:02.165
The champion unleashes a surprise attack!

00:02:02.189 --> 00:02:05.034
You're gonna pay for what you've done!

00:02:05.058 --> 00:02:07.237
Don't think you can leave unharmed!

00:02:07.261 --> 00:02:13.325
"The Devil's Payback”

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:16.880
The champion starts
the match on a rampage!

00:02:16.904 --> 00:02:19.883
Shinogi Kureha is down in no time flat!

00:02:19.907 --> 00:02:20.817
Brother...

00:02:20.841 --> 00:02:23.811
--Whoa...!
--Such swift attacks...!

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:28.691
Shinogi Kureha! This isn't a match!

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:29.826
What?!

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:32.945
This is your punishment!

00:02:35.956 --> 00:02:38.134
The bastard's all fired up!

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:40.855
Punishment...?

00:02:52.272 --> 00:02:55.218
The champion delivers
a devastating uppercut!

00:02:55.242 --> 00:02:58.405
But he's not letting him
go down just yet!

00:03:00.447 --> 00:03:03.693
The champion attacks relentlessly!

00:03:03.717 --> 00:03:05.811
This one's gonna finish it!

00:03:17.497 --> 00:03:18.808
Yes!

00:03:18.832 --> 00:03:20.476
He did it!

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.145
He did it!

00:03:22.169 --> 00:03:25.014
Though he isn't even 70 kg in weight,

00:03:25.038 --> 00:03:31.354
the champion cut down his nearly-130 kg
challenger in no time at all!

00:03:31.378 --> 00:03:33.323
Hanma Baki is incredible!

00:03:33.347 --> 00:03:37.306
This could be a new record
for the shortest match ever!

00:03:41.555 --> 00:03:45.635
--He finished him just like that!
--He's good...

00:03:45.659 --> 00:03:47.904
No...

00:03:47.928 --> 00:03:50.506
You're Shinogi Kosho!

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:53.676
That isn't the extent
of my brother's strength.

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:56.246
The true Hell is just about to begin.

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:59.399
--What?!
--He's getting up!

00:04:04.144 --> 00:04:06.875
Ah. So that's what this is about...

00:04:14.688 --> 00:04:16.933
Shinogi Kureha is back up!

00:04:16.957 --> 00:04:20.336
It's as if that torrent of attacks
didn't hurt him one bit!

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:26.458
So my patients cajoled you
into "helping serve justice"...

00:04:33.507 --> 00:04:37.620
Unfortunately, none of you
seem to understand.

00:04:37.644 --> 00:04:40.590
Because of the experimental
treatments I performed on you,

00:04:40.614 --> 00:04:44.160
my knowledge and techniques
have made incredible progress!

00:04:44.184 --> 00:04:47.864
Medical science owes
a great deal to you!

00:04:47.888 --> 00:04:52.435
I also turned your dull
lives into significant ones!

00:04:52.459 --> 00:04:54.737
You should be thankful.

00:04:54.761 --> 00:05:00.343
And I needn"t mention that your
operations were complete successes.

00:05:00.367 --> 00:05:03.579
It is illogical for you to resent me.

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:08.451
Like hell it is! My daughter
still can't stand up!

00:05:08.475 --> 00:05:12.355
You took large sums of illegal money
but still screwed up!

00:05:12.379 --> 00:05:16.941
Had you done real treatment,
Yasuko could've walked again!

00:05:18.352 --> 00:05:20.596
No matter how advanced the operation,

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:24.801
if a patient's body is weak,
any treatment will fail.

00:05:24.825 --> 00:05:29.038
If you want something to curse,
then curse your body's weakness!

00:05:29.062 --> 00:05:34.177
You pledged you would not object
to the results of your operations!

00:05:34.201 --> 00:05:38.114
But if you're going to
pass judgment on me, then fine!

00:05:38.138 --> 00:05:40.106
I'll be happy to take you on!

00:05:41.241 --> 00:05:44.220
Is that all you got to say, you quack?

00:05:44.244 --> 00:05:45.722
You lousy brat...

00:05:45.746 --> 00:05:52.061
Since you don't understand people's pain,
I'll teach it to you now.

00:05:52.085 --> 00:05:53.463
Without anesthesia!

00:05:53.487 --> 00:05:57.947
| was unable to predict
your incomprehensible, swift attacks...

00:06:01.161 --> 00:06:04.774
...-.but my checkup of your
offensive power is now complete.

00:06:04.798 --> 00:06:09.112
Shinogi Kurehais in a
serious stance for the first time!

00:06:09.136 --> 00:06:11.247
He's like a fortress of flesh!

00:06:11.271 --> 00:06:14.217
Don't do it, Brother...!

00:06:14.241 --> 00:06:16.419
Orochi Doppo revived?!

00:06:16.443 --> 00:06:19.655
Yes, his emergency treatment
was successful.

00:06:19.679 --> 00:06:22.225
So he cheated death in that condition?

00:06:22.249 --> 00:06:26.162
It's too early to be surprised.
The doctor's name was Shinogi Kureha,

00:06:26.186 --> 00:06:29.053
and he's fighting Baki as we speak.

00:06:30.257 --> 00:06:33.102
Interesting. I wanna see this man!

00:06:33.126 --> 00:06:33.456
Interesting. I wanna see this man!

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:36.927
Come straight at me!

00:06:54.014 --> 00:06:57.627
The champion is down!
The 130 kg Shinogi Kureha

00:06:57.651 --> 00:06:59.847
isn't being outdone by his movements!

00:07:08.028 --> 00:07:11.407
A powerful counter by Shinogi Kureha!

00:07:11.431 --> 00:07:15.945
He unleashes a torrent of attacks
that outshine even the champion's!

00:07:15.969 --> 00:07:19.982
--Your son seems to be in a pinch.
--He's not serious...

00:07:20.006 --> 00:07:22.685
What?! He's not fighting seriously?!

00:07:22.709 --> 00:07:25.354
Shinogi Kureha has the upper hand!

00:07:25.378 --> 00:07:28.024
Is the champion already
losing consciousness?!

00:07:28.048 --> 00:07:30.016
He's not even trying to dodge!

00:07:33.487 --> 00:07:37.667
--Run! Baki!
--It's no use once he gets caught...!

00:07:37.691 --> 00:07:40.319
Do you have knotholes for eyes?!

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:47.210
That was intense!
The champion's in trouble!

00:07:47.234 --> 00:07:49.846
Shinogi-san.

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:53.349
Sorry, but none of your attacks
have any effect.

00:07:53.373 --> 00:07:55.985
You could do this all night
and not hurt me!

00:07:56.009 --> 00:07:59.288
Astounding! Despite all those attacks,

00:07:59.312 --> 00:08:01.958
the champion is completely undamaged!

00:08:01.982 --> 00:08:03.893
Is Hanma Baki immortal?!

00:08:03.917 --> 00:08:06.896
It appeared that he had attacked
with overwhelming power,

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.398
but all his pre-attack movements
were so large

00:08:09.422 --> 00:08:13.169
and his rhythm so monotonous
that they were all seen through.

00:08:13.193 --> 00:08:15.304
Telephone punches, huh?

00:08:15.328 --> 00:08:17.740
One can't win with muscle alone.

00:08:17.764 --> 00:08:21.344
Though I doubt that doctor
doesn't know that.

00:08:21.368 --> 00:08:25.147
Every time you hit me,
every time you threw me,

00:08:25.171 --> 00:08:27.316
you missed my vital spots.

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:30.319
For me, those attacks
were like a massage!

00:08:30.343 --> 00:08:31.654
What?!

00:08:31.678 --> 00:08:34.190
You shouldn't cut corners, Doctor!

00:08:34.214 --> 00:08:36.706
Damn you!

00:08:38.451 --> 00:08:40.196
It's no use!

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:43.599
You can't win around here
with brute strength alone!

00:08:43.623 --> 00:08:45.284
Come at me seriously!

00:08:47.761 --> 00:08:51.574
I had wanted to save this
for my fight with your father,

00:08:51.598 --> 00:08:54.090
but it seems I have no choice.

00:08:55.735 --> 00:08:57.669
That's more like it!

00:09:00.874 --> 00:09:01.851
Baki-kun.

00:09:01.875 --> 00:09:05.521
Do you know where the worst place
to break a bone is?

00:09:05.545 --> 00:09:08.724
Behind the shoulder blade,
where a cast can't be applied!

00:09:08.748 --> 00:09:10.113
Right here!

00:09:11.651 --> 00:09:14.746
--Baki!
--Is this his true nature?!

00:09:15.922 --> 00:09:18.634
What on earth happened?!

00:09:18.658 --> 00:09:23.339
Pick apart a fighting technique
and you'll run into anatomy.

00:09:23.363 --> 00:09:27.343
But other than me, all fighters
have only faint ideas about it

00:09:27.367 --> 00:09:29.579
based on pathetic experiences and books.

00:09:29.603 --> 00:09:31.314
But not him.

00:09:31.338 --> 00:09:36.419
No fighter in this world is as
well-versed on the human body as him.

00:09:36.443 --> 00:09:41.624
Though he learned everything
at school and in hospitals, unlike me.

00:09:41.648 --> 00:09:44.393
Well, Baki-kun. Time for my lecture.

00:09:44.417 --> 00:09:46.181
First is the stomach!

00:09:48.622 --> 00:09:53.402
Striking with the wrist at a 30° angle
is effective on the innards.

00:09:53.426 --> 00:09:55.438
Next is the liver!

00:09:55.462 --> 00:09:56.939
This part!

00:09:56.963 --> 00:10:01.077
60° beneath the right ribcage,
so as to leave it throbbing!

00:10:01.101 --> 00:10:04.180
The bastard's really giving a lecture!

00:10:04.204 --> 00:10:07.717
As for damage to the brain,
although far from complete,

00:10:07.741 --> 00:10:11.654
you fighters appear to
understand quite a bit about it.

00:10:11.678 --> 00:10:14.290
In the case of the brain,
rather than attacking the head directly,

00:10:14.314 --> 00:10:16.626
it's better to aim for the chin.

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:20.763
In this situation, a palm is
more practical than a fist.

00:10:20.787 --> 00:10:23.449
From 30 degrees below, speedily...!

00:10:30.530 --> 00:10:33.142
The champion goes down hard!

00:10:33.166 --> 00:10:36.579
Shinogi Kureha stands imposingly!

00:10:36.603 --> 00:10:41.584
Your brain should be wobbling
around like pudding now.

00:10:41.608 --> 00:10:44.475
Though I doubt you can hear me.

00:10:45.311 --> 00:10:46.989
Is this the end...2?!

00:10:47.013 --> 00:10:49.880
| had no idea he was this strong...!

00:10:51.851 --> 00:10:55.364
Now this is a nice surprise.

00:10:55.388 --> 00:11:00.636
It does seem that a part of a fighter's
instincts is beyond understanding.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:02.538
Baki-san...

00:11:02.562 --> 00:11:08.878
Thanks to you, I can start my final
lecture meant for Hanma Yujiro.

00:11:08.902 --> 00:11:10.880
Seems he's aware of you.

00:11:10.904 --> 00:11:17.153
About 60% of the human body
is made of water, my dizzy boy.

00:11:17.177 --> 00:11:20.756
The technique that can give
the most effective shock

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:24.326
to such a water pillow-like
body's circulatory organs

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:27.563
is not a punch or even a chop.

00:11:27.587 --> 00:11:30.199
It's a move I can only do
because I'm a doctor...

00:11:30.223 --> 00:11:32.123
...this Dashin! {Tremor Strike)

00:11:39.699 --> 00:11:40.894
Baki-san...!

00:11:42.602 --> 00:11:44.195
Class dismissed.

00:12:03.189 --> 00:12:07.903
The champion is completely still!
What exactly happened to him?!

00:12:07.927 --> 00:12:10.406
--Was that karate?!
--I don't know...

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:13.008
- It resembled the Hokuha.
--Hokuha?

00:12:13.032 --> 00:12:16.245
Unlike karate, which emphasizes
making the body harder than rock

00:12:16.269 --> 00:12:19.582
to destroy a person's skeletal frame,

00:12:19.606 --> 00:12:23.486
the Hokuha style of northern China
centers on the idea

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.454
that a person is water.

00:12:25.478 --> 00:12:26.355
Water?

00:12:26.379 --> 00:12:31.460
Yes. Normally, this water
absorbs shocks from the outside,

00:12:31.484 --> 00:12:34.964
but the Hokuha is
designed to use the water

00:12:34.988 --> 00:12:38.801
to impart an even greater shock
to the inside of the body.

00:12:38.825 --> 00:12:43.739
I can't believe this Shinogi Kureha
figured it out on his own...!

00:12:43.763 --> 00:12:45.674
He could do it.

00:12:45.698 --> 00:12:48.978
Almost everyday he operates
on others and has fully learned

00:12:49.002 --> 00:12:51.494
the structure of the human body...

00:12:52.372 --> 00:12:54.917
Hanma Yujiro!

00:12:54.941 --> 00:12:55.918
Yujiro?!

00:12:55.942 --> 00:12:57.535
When did he--

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:03.325
| doubt you're having fun just watching!

00:13:03.349 --> 00:13:05.928
| assume I interest you!

00:13:05.952 --> 00:13:09.098
If you want to fight me, get down here!

00:13:09.122 --> 00:13:12.368
"Get down here"?! You runt...!

00:13:12.392 --> 00:13:13.917
Yujiro?!

00:13:24.237 --> 00:13:27.783
Hanma Yujiro has barged into the match!

00:13:27.807 --> 00:13:30.052
My word...!

00:13:30.076 --> 00:13:35.024
How dare you call me out
as if you were some great fighter!

00:13:35.048 --> 00:13:40.296
I hear you're known
as the "world's strongest being"...

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:43.899
You should've kept to your microscopes.

00:13:43.923 --> 00:13:46.984
| was just thinking
how Doppo wasn't enough...

00:13:50.763 --> 00:13:53.909
Get out of here, Dad!

00:13:53.933 --> 00:13:57.046
Are you still planning
to fight me in that condition?

00:13:57.070 --> 00:14:00.916
Of course I am!
The fight's not over yet...!

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:02.218
No more!

00:14:02.242 --> 00:14:04.119
Yasuko?!

00:14:04.143 --> 00:14:08.190
You don't need to get hurt for our sakes...!

00:14:08.214 --> 00:14:11.794
I don't want to see
any more people get hurt...!

00:14:11.818 --> 00:14:13.696
Please, Baki-san...

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:16.465
Please stop this...!

00:14:16.489 --> 00:14:22.223
Don't get the wrong idea!
I'm not fighting for your sakes!

00:14:23.062 --> 00:14:28.077
I'm not fighting for anyone but myself!

00:14:28.101 --> 00:14:31.380
| have a reason why
| absolutely can't lose!

00:14:31.404 --> 00:14:33.782
I'm going to win this fight...

00:14:33.806 --> 00:14:36.919
---and then stand before him!

00:14:36.943 --> 00:14:40.456
Until then, I can't
afford to lose to anyone!

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:41.924
Baki-san...

00:14:41.948 --> 00:14:45.094
So I'm just a stepping stone
to Hanma Yujiro...

00:14:45.118 --> 00:14:46.896
What an insult.

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:49.732
I don't know what has
transpired between you two,

00:14:49.756 --> 00:14:52.234
but if you're still planning
to win in your condition

00:14:52.258 --> 00:14:55.304
then I must question your sanity.

00:14:55.328 --> 00:14:58.340
Shinogi Kureha. You're going to lose.

00:14:58.364 --> 00:14:59.341
What?!

00:14:59.365 --> 00:15:00.976
And because of only one hit.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.245
What?!

00:15:03.269 --> 00:15:05.180
Good form, Baki.

00:15:05.204 --> 00:15:08.139
But miss and you're done for.

00:15:13.613 --> 00:15:16.759
It seems your daddy has
quite some faith in you.

00:15:16.783 --> 00:15:20.162
Just as he said,
this will be the final attack!

00:15:20.186 --> 00:15:24.266
<i>Oh, please. Do you really think
you can beat me with one hit?</i>

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:29.004
With the damage to my ribs,
| probably can't with my right arm.

00:15:29.028 --> 00:15:34.276
But with one hit from this left fist
| can beat you for sure!

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:35.277
What...?!

00:15:35.301 --> 00:15:36.826
He's going to beat him?!

00:15:37.804 --> 00:15:42.184
So why didn't you use this
handy technique of yours earlier?

00:15:42.208 --> 00:15:46.655
The same as you.
| was saving it for Hanma Yujiro.

00:15:46.679 --> 00:15:48.390
I see.

00:15:48.414 --> 00:15:51.714
In that case,
perhaps I should be somewhat cautious.

00:15:52.885 --> 00:15:57.900
The idea of "one-shot one-kill"
has long been held in the karate world.

00:15:57.924 --> 00:16:00.869
Much like faith toward God.

00:16:00.893 --> 00:16:05.040
In recent years, all the matches
that go by pedantic full-contact rules

00:16:05.064 --> 00:16:08.043
have shattered that
superstition into pieces,

00:16:08.067 --> 00:16:10.446
but although it's extremely high-level,

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:14.566
it's not impossible
if certain conditions are met!

00:16:18.611 --> 00:16:20.689
My face is completely covered.

00:16:20.713 --> 00:16:23.459
If he's going to hit me,
it'tl be my body!

00:16:23.483 --> 00:16:25.761
But that will pose no problem at all.

00:16:25.785 --> 00:16:29.698
These abdominal muscles could stop
even a punch from Hanma Yujiro!

00:16:29.722 --> 00:16:33.602
And when he loses his balance,
I'tl give him another Dashin!

00:16:33.626 --> 00:16:35.104
And that'll end it!

00:16:35.128 --> 00:16:38.907
He's aiming for my stomach!
That's not a weak spot to me!

00:16:38.931 --> 00:16:41.730
Time to fall apart, Hanma Baki!

00:17:21.274 --> 00:17:23.038
The match is over!

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:25.988
Yes!

00:17:26.012 --> 00:17:30.893
It's all over! The champion
defeats Shinogi Kureha!

00:17:30.917 --> 00:17:36.799
At the end of the back-and-forth match,
the champion came out on top!

00:17:36.823 --> 00:17:39.902
--What was that...?!
--Gotai-jutsu!

00:17:39.926 --> 00:17:41.703
Gotai-jutsu?

00:17:41.727 --> 00:17:44.940
In it, a fighter hardens his body
at the moment of impact

00:17:44.964 --> 00:17:49.044
and tightens all the muscles used
when performing a seiken punch.

00:17:49.068 --> 00:17:51.380
It's exceedingly difficult,
but if done properly,

00:17:51.404 --> 00:17:55.284
you can place your entire weight
into your fist.

00:17:55.308 --> 00:17:58.987
There is no imitating this technique;
one can only learn its timing

00:17:59.011 --> 00:18:01.412
on the most horrific of battlefields!

00:18:15.294 --> 00:18:18.264
"Medical Room"

00:18:26.873 --> 00:18:30.241
His stomach is ripped open.
It's a hellish pain.

00:18:43.623 --> 00:18:47.703
--They said he needs surgery right away.
--1 hit him with that intent.

00:18:47.727 --> 00:18:48.937
What...?!

00:18:48.961 --> 00:18:51.328
I don't think I went too far.

00:18:52.865 --> 00:18:57.846
You're right. Neither of us
is in a position to blame you...

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:02.284
But what can a winner possibly
do by seeing the loser...?!

00:19:02.308 --> 00:19:04.299
I'm not the one who wants to see him.

00:19:06.245 --> 00:19:07.872
You're--

00:19:15.922 --> 00:19:18.333
B- Baki-san. We've had enough...!

00:19:18.357 --> 00:19:23.056
What do you mean, "enough”?
You should enjoy watching this.

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:27.109
Wasn't this what you wanted?!

00:19:27.133 --> 00:19:29.478
Baki...! Damn you!

00:19:29.502 --> 00:19:32.247
Anyone have Type AB blood?!

00:19:32.271 --> 00:19:36.765
<i>Type AB! A man's life is on the line!</i>

00:19:48.621 --> 00:19:50.953
| have Type AB.

00:19:54.327 --> 00:19:56.557
Yasuko...!

00:20:02.435 --> 00:20:06.548
As I watched Baki-san get back up
every time he fell down...

00:20:06.572 --> 00:20:08.183
Yasuko...!

00:20:08.207 --> 00:20:13.222
---1 wondered if the reason |
couldn't stand up after the surgery...

00:20:13.246 --> 00:20:18.912
...was actually because somewhere
in my heart, I had given up...

00:20:20.253 --> 00:20:23.232
If I can be of use...

00:20:23.256 --> 00:20:26.435
Patients aren't healed
by doctor's techniques.

00:20:26.459 --> 00:20:28.971
It's the patients' desire to get better.

00:20:28.995 --> 00:20:31.673
If someone doesn't have
the desire to get better,

00:20:31.697 --> 00:20:34.792
not even the best doctor
is qualified enough.

00:20:43.843 --> 00:20:45.187
Kozue-chan.

00:20:45.211 --> 00:20:50.325
I'd like to leave for a while.
Could you take care of Musashi?

00:20:50.349 --> 00:20:53.395
Sure, but why so suddenly...?

00:20:53.419 --> 00:20:54.596
No reason...

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:57.199
I'll be back in a couple days.

00:20:57.223 --> 00:20:59.954
Hey, wait! Baki-kun!

00:21:12.772 --> 00:21:14.866
My ribs still hurt...

00:21:26.252 --> 00:21:27.742
Dad...!

00:21:29.221 --> 00:21:31.189
You're close at hand now!

00:21:47.573 --> 00:21:50.185
It's been a long time, Elder!

00:21:50.209 --> 00:21:52.405
I'm here to find myself!

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:50.379
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.403 --> 00:22:55.984
hangs onto love
in one corner of the pavement

00:22:56.008 --> 00:23:01.656
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.680 --> 00:23:06.661
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.685 --> 00:23:12.200
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.224 --> 00:23:17.739
gently enveloped in love

00:23:17.763 --> 00:23:23.412
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.436 --> 00:23:28.950
but they will be reborn

00:23:28.974 --> 00:23:34.623
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.647 --> 00:23:41.314
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:51.964 --> 00:23:58.947
"The monsters are coming..."

00:23:58.971 --> 00:24:05.954
"Who is the world's strongest man?"

00:24:05.978 --> 00:24:13.817
"Grappler Baki-
The Greatest Tournament Chapter”

00:24:15.421 --> 00:24:19.915
"Grappler Baki-
The Greatest Tournament Chapter”
